<p>An editor-authored panel with a body passes through as raw storage:</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="1a2b3c4d-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" ac:local-id="9f00" ac:name="panel" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="bgColor">#eae6ff</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>Panel <strong>content</strong> survives.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p>A bodyless leaf macro passes through as raw storage: <ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id="1a2b3c4d-0000-0000-0000-000000000002" ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Green</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">DONE</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p>
